sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as React Frontend
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite/PostgreSQL
  participant EMB as Retrieval (LaBSE or hashing)
  participant LLM as Groq (optional)
  User->>UI: Ask a question, choose answer language
  UI->>API: POST /ask
  API->>DB: Load indexed documents
  DB-->>API: Records
  API->>EMB: Embed query and documents
  EMB-->>API: Ranked context
  alt Relevant documents and Groq enabled
    API->>LLM: Prompt with cited context
    LLM-->>API: Answer in requested language
  else Offline / no key
    API->>API: Extract matching source sentences
  end
  API->>DB: Persist question, answer and sources
  API-->>UI: Answer, source IDs and mode
  UI-->>User: Render answer and live graphs
